      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it's just... it never really changes, does it? it just gets harder and more lonely. i feel like i'm just taking up space, waiting for a body that doesn't work anymore to finally give out. it feels like i've lost all my agency. everything just happens *to* me now. everything is just a slow decay.",
