      "content": "it's just exhausting, you know? constantly being told it might get better, but looking at the reality of it... there isn't much left to look forward to. it feels like i'm a passenger in my own life, just watching it slip away bit by bit. wouldn't it be more dignified to have some say in how it ends, rather than just waiting for the lights to flicker out on their own?",
